  "contentHtml": "<p>어디에 자료를 올려야 할지 몰라 여기에 올립니다.&#160;</p><p>2028학년도 대입(현 고1)부터 적용되는&#160;</p><p>대입 이수 권장 과목을 대학에서 8월까지 올리는 것으로 알고 있습니다.</p><p>이전에 자료를 올린 서울대, 경희대, 건국대를 포함하여</p><p>오늘까지 추가된 대학 자료 정리하여 올립니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/668151a230748016b9ae2a221f1bc8f3f7b33bef?download\" data-file-name=\"동국대.pdf\" data-file-size=\"684792\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DesFT%26dataid%3D48%26fileid%3D6%26regdt%3D20250829183753&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F668151a230748016b9ae2a221f1bc8f3f7b33bef')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">동국대</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">668.74KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5160f42ce86a6d06154b7b76402ed20869a37906?download\" data-file-name=\"부산대.pdf\" data-file-size=\"129071\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DesFT%26dataid%3D48%26fileid%3D8%26regdt%3D20250829183753&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F5160f42ce86a6d06154b7b76402ed20869a37906')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">부산대</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">126.05KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5abab38f2bf331e5a406fea99d9498d79128faae?download\" data-file-name=\"서울대.pdf\" data-file-size=\"164511\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DesFT%26dataid%3D48%26fileid%3D7%26regdt%3D20250829183753&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net